# CodeRabbit lessons (agent habits)

Merge-gate / quota / when-to-request → `pr-review-merge.mdc` + `CONTRIBUTING.md`. Issues → `github-issues.mdc`.

## Disposition triad (every actionable finding)

Never leave hanging (threads **and** outside-diff / summary nits):

1. **Fix** → resolve thread
2. **Wontfix** → short PR reply + resolve
3. **Defer** → open follow-up issue, link from PR reply, resolve

## `Refs` vs `Closes` / stubs

- Incomplete acceptance / deepen-in-progress → `Refs #N`, never `Closes`
- Stubs / `assert!(… \|\| true)` / “smoke only” ≠ done

## Durable code habits

**Cross-crate / living_room**

- `./scripts/check.sh` excludes `living_room` unless `SPEC_CHUM_CHECK_LIVING_ROOM=1`
- Shared FFI / `host_api` / tape options → also `./scripts/check_living_room.sh`; grep `living_room` + `apps/macos`

**Struct / API fields**

- New public struct fields break all struct-literal sites — grep constructors + FFI; keep egui / macOS / `host_api` / `living_room` in sync

**Tests**

- Assert real outcomes (not `assert!(true)` / hand-forced state)
- Meaningful preconditions; ROM tests skip cleanly without `roms/`
- No copy-pasted synthetic media builders across crates — share helper or defer with issue

**Tape / EAR / UI**

- One EAR/pulse convention; UI must match active load path (flash vs EAR)
- Empty / pulse-free decks: honest progress + completion

**Frame / audio**

- Carry speaker/AY/late edges across frame boundary; saturating progress math; don’t print OK after soft budget fail

**Host / ABI / input**

- One C-header source of truth; keep UI model ↔ machine model aligned on snapshot load
- Don’t leave guest input latched when host disables it; reset-as-model-reselect must preserve/reinsert media intentionally
- Living-room: don’t block UI on room queue; generation-safe stall recovery

**Errors / I/O**

- Don’t discard `Result` from play/start/write/init; buffer traces (no per-event reopen); atomic downloads; no hardcoded machine paths

**CI / packaging (when touched)**

- Pin Actions to SHAs; keep crate version + macOS numeric bundle version in sync
